sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant User as Site Manager
    participant FE as Frontend (recharts dashboard)
    participant API as Analytics API (/api/v1/analytics)
    participant MV as Materialized views
    participant EXP as Export service\n(Excel/CSV, POI-based)

    User->>FE: opens Site Dashboard
    FE->>API: GET /api/v1/analytics/occupancy?siteId=...
    API->>MV: SELECT from mv_site_occupancy
    MV-->>API: current count, fill rate
    API-->>FE: JSON (tenant/site scoped)
    FE->>FE: render recharts (bar/line/heatmap)

    User->>FE: clicks "Export report"
    FE->>API: GET /api/v1/analytics/export?siteId=...&range=...&format=xlsx
    API->>MV: query aggregates for range
    MV-->>API: rows
    API->>EXP: build workbook (mirrors VehicleLogExportService\nApache POI pattern)
    EXP-->>API: byte[] (.xlsx or .csv)
    API-->>FE: file download (Content-Disposition attachment)
    FE-->>User: saves report file
